{"step_index":186,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-27T03:21:16Z","thinking":"**Analyzing the First Tab**\n\nI've begun examining the first tab, \"본질관통 - 열혈 변호사 신주영의...\". My focus is now centered on this tab, where I'm trying to decipher its content to understand its relation to my work.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Switch to main player tab and capture","UserFacing":false},"CodeContent":"using System;\nusing System.Text;\nusing System.Drawing;\nusing System.Drawing.Imaging;\nusing System.Runtime.InteropServices;\nusing System.Threading;\nusing System.Windows.Forms;\n\npublic class TabSwitcher {\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\", SetLastError = true)]\n    public static extern IntPtr OpenWindowStation(string lpszWinSta, bool fInherit, uint dwDesiredAccess);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\", SetLastError = true)]\n    public static extern bool SetProcessWindowStation(IntPtr hWinSta);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\", SetLastError = true)]\n    public static extern IntPtr OpenDesktop(string lpszDesktop, uint dwFlags, bool fInherit, uint dwDesiredAccess);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\", SetLastError = true)]\n    public static extern bool SetThreadDesktop(IntPtr hDesktop);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern bool SetForegroundWindow(IntPtr hWnd);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern void mouse_event(uint dwFlags, uint dx, uint dy, uint dwData, int dwExtraInfo);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern bool SetCursorPos(int X, int Y);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    public static extern bool PrintWindow(IntPtr hWnd, IntPtr hdcBmp, uint nFlags);\n    [DllImport(\"user32.dll\")]\n    [return: MarshalAs(UnmanagedType.Bool)]\n    public static extern bool GetWindowRect(IntPtr hWnd, out RECT lpRect);\n\n    const uint MOUSEEVENTF_LEFTDOWN = 0x0002;\n    const uint MOUSEEVENTF_LEFTUP   = 0x0004;\n\n    [StructLayout(LayoutKind.Sequential)]\n    public struct RECT {\n        public int Left, Top, Right, Bottom;\n    }\n\n    public static void SwitchAndCapture(IntPtr hWnd, string savePath) {\n        IntPtr hwinsta = OpenWindowStation(\"WinSta0\", false, 0x037F);\n        if (hwinsta != IntPtr.Zero) SetProcessWindowStation(hwinsta);\n        IntPtr hdesk = OpenDesktop(\"default\", 0, false, 0x01FF);\n        if (hdesk != IntPtr.Zero) SetThreadDesktop(hdesk);\n\n        SetForegroundWindow(hWnd);\n        Thread.Sleep(300);\n\n        // Click Tab 1 at (150, 40)\n        SetCursorPos(150, 40);\n        Thread.Sleep(50);\n        mouse_event(MOUSEEVENTF_LEFTDOWN, 150, 40, 0, 0);\n        Thread.Sleep(50);\n        mouse_event(MOUSEEVENTF_LEFTUP, 150, 40, 0, 0);\n\n        Thread.Sleep(1000);\n\n        RECT r;\n        GetWindowRect(hWnd, out r);\n        int w = r.Right - r.Left;\n        int h = r.Bottom - r.Top;\n        using (Bitmap bmp = new Bitmap(w, h)) {\n            using (Graphics g = Graphics.FromImage(bmp)) {\n                IntPtr hdc = g.GetHdc();\n                PrintWindow(hWnd, hdc, 2);\n                g.ReleaseHdc(hdc);\n            }\n            bmp.Save(savePath, ImageFormat.Png);\n            Console.WriteLine(\"Saved: \" + savePath);\n        }\n    }\n}\n","Description":"Switch to main player tab and capture","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\lg\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\44470555-939d-4160-8744-09bb2f099064\\scratch\\TabSwitcher.cs","toolAction":"Writing TabSwitcher.cs","toolSummary":"Tab switcher script"}}]}
